## 3. Final Event Types

| Event Type | Triggers | Payload Fields | Transaction Boundary |
|---|---|---|---|
| **ORDER_ACCEPTED** | Valid order submitted (AC1) | orderId, accountId, instrumentId, side, quantity, orderType, acceptedStatus, clientReference, acceptedTimestamp | Same as order save |
| **PRICE_DECISION** | Execution-time quote evaluated (AC2) | orderId, instrumentId, side, quoteId, quotedAt, bid, ask, midpoint, selectedPrice, freshness, synthetic, source, decision, attemptNumber | Before fill attempt |
| **ORDER_FILLED** | Successful fill executed (AC3) | orderId, fillId, quantity, executionPrice, quoteTimestamp, fillTimestamp, instrumentId, side | Same as fill + ledger + status |
| **ORDER_REJECTED** | Max attempts exceeded | orderId, reasonCode, attemptNumber, maxAttempts, rejectionTimestamp, quoteEvidence (PRICE_DECISION payload) | Same as order status update |
| **ORDER_REQUEUED** | Transient failure (retry) | orderId, attemptNumber, reasonCode, nextExecutionTime, backoffSeconds, quoteEvidence (PRICE_DECISION or no-quote) | Same as order save |
| **SETTLEMENT_FAILED** | Settlement fails catastrophically | orderId, reason, attemptNumber | Post-rollback only (future) |

